WEBVTT

00:08.400 --> 00:13.480
The first year of Longwu you ascended the throne from then on domestically.

00:13.560 --> 00:19.240
You purged Prince Ning's remnants stabilized the court opened the borders absorbed northern refugees.

00:19.320 --> 00:24.600
Increased population built strategic towns sharpened weapons and fed horses externally.

00:24.680 --> 00:29.520
You sent envoys to former allies repaired relations with the Murong clan of Yandong.

00:30.320 --> 00:36.120
Though you constantly think of the northern expedition you deeply understand to achieve victory in one campaign.

00:36.200 --> 00:39.080
This war requires thorough preparation.

00:40.840 --> 00:46.360
For over ten years xuan's foundation under your rule has gradually recovered.

00:46.560 --> 00:49.320
Now the time is near.

00:53.720 --> 00:58.160
The enemy cavalry is strong direct engagement is unfavorable to us but fortunately.

00:58.240 --> 01:03.680
Our Xuan territory has great strategic depth we should avoid decisive battle with the enemy.

01:03.840 --> 01:06.560
Let the enemy penetrate deep into our heartland.

01:07.560 --> 01:12.560
Once the Wuzhao penetrate deep we will along the way implement scorched earth tactics.

01:12.760 --> 01:17.840
Then send cavalry to raid cut off Wuzhao supply lines especially after the rainy season.

01:18.000 --> 01:23.480
Newly formed river paths can slow the enemy cavalry at the same time our forces maneuver.

01:23.560 --> 01:24.960
In guerrilla warfare.

01:25.840 --> 01:31.200
In this way if we can eliminate in one stroke the enemy's effective forces then the central plains.

01:31.280 --> 01:35.120
Can be secured second brother not to mention.

01:35.200 --> 01:40.867
How dangerous it is to let enemies cross Tianhe Your scorched earth strategy will harm how many people?

01:41.000 --> 01:46.040
Even if we win you achieve success the dead will not be just ten thousand.

01:46.120 --> 01:51.320
War always has casualties today's brief pain for eternal peace why not?

01:52.680 --> 01:56.707
Then, elder brother, you say this war how should it be fought?

01:57.400 --> 02:03.280
The key is to increase Xuan's overall strength I have a treatise on land A strategy I devised to strengthen the state.

02:03.400 --> 02:08.480
Using Beiyuguan as a barrier engage in attrition warfare with the Wuzhao the Wuzhao are good at fighting.

02:08.560 --> 02:12.600
But poor at logistics and prone to infighting fight a war of attrition with them.

02:12.680 --> 02:18.080
Drag until their internal affairs collapse supplies cut off then the Wuzhao will surely be defeated.

02:18.160 --> 02:21.120
This is victory through governance.

02:21.560 --> 02:24.893
Then you won't care about the people in the north?

02:25.360 --> 02:30.013
All things have priorities choose the important and do it first.

02:30.120 --> 02:33.120
This is the principle Father taught us since childhood.

02:35.840 --> 02:37.240
Well said.

